    "text": "A shaft with a window into a second shaft. Both choke at about the same level.\n\nAt Easter 2009, a possible sighting and re-exploration has the depth at 13.4m with a window 4m up leading to a river passage. This is unlikely to be Sima del Burro. The grid reference is 30T 0453878 4794181 (Eur79). A few metres away is an \"unrecorded shaft\" at 30T 0453874 4794184 (Eur79) with an estimated depth of 25m. It has the sound of water and is presumed to link to the first hole.\n\nThese hole(s) are out of the current permit area.\n\nConstruction of the svx file from the survey gave a length of 94m (previously 50m) ."
  },
